# Maths that prettier rewrites. Prettier 3.9.9 reads the asterisk pairs in
# `$\mathbf{z}^* = (L^*, W^*, H^*, \theta^*)$` as emphasis and prints them as `^_`,
# which corrupts the LaTeX, and the format-docs hook then refuses every commit that
# stages Markdown. 3.9.6 and 3.9.8 leave the file alone; 3.9.9 is the latest release.
# Remove this entry when a release does too.
data/maths/proposals/20260222-geometry-coherent-tracking.md

